73861 BCX8">This is a highly cross-functional role at the intersection of <strong>product, customer experience, data, technology, marketing, and commercial strategy</strong>. You will work with a dedicated product team as well as partners across the organization to turn growth opportunities into measurable outcomes.</p><p class="Paragraph SCXW6873861 BCX8" style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW6873861 BCX8"><strong><span style="color:#0F4761">What you'll do</span></strong><span style="color:#0F4761">&nbsp;</span></p><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW6873861 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW6873861 BCX8"><strong>Own growth outcomes, not just features.</strong> Define ambitious goals and translate them into a focused product and experimentation strategy with clear, measurable KPIs.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW6873861 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW6873861 BCX8"><strong>Identify growth opportunities.</strong> Use quantitative data, customer insights, market trends, and experimentation to uncover opportunities across acquisition, activation, engagement, retention, conversion, and monetization.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW6873861 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW6873861 BCX8"><strong>Build and prioritize a growth roadmap.</strong> Decide where the biggest opportunities lie and balance quick experiments with larger strategic bets.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW6873861 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW6873861 BCX8"><strong>Experiment systematically.</strong> Develop hypotheses, design experiments, evaluate results, and use learnings to determine what to iterate, scale, or stop.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW6873861 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW6873861 BCX8"><strong>Turn successful experiments into scalable products.</strong> Go beyond optimization and ensure that validated ideas become sustainable capabilities and customer experiences.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW6873861 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW6873861 BCX8"><strong>Partner closely with Engineering, Design, Data, Marketing, and Commercial teams</strong> to move from opportunity to execution while keeping teams aligned around outcomes.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW6873861 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW6873861 BCX8"><strong>Develop a deep understanding of our customers.</strong> Combine behavioral data with qualitative research to understand customer needs, motivations, and friction points.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW6873861 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW6873861 BCX8"><strong>Make evidence-based decisions.</strong> Define success metrics, evaluate impact, and use data to distinguish signal from noise.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW6873861 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW6873861 BCX8"><strong>Think beyond the existing product.</strong> Proactively explore new propositions, business models, customer journeys, and product opportunities that could unlock additional growth.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW6873861 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW6873861 BCX8"><strong>Provide product leadership.</strong> Bring structure to ambiguous problems, communicate clearly with stakeholders, challenge established thinking, and help raise the bar for product management across the organization.</p></li></ul> <br> <ul><li><p>Several years of Product Management experience, ideally in Growth, Conversion, Retention, Engagement, or Monetization</p></li><li><p>Proven track record of delivering measurable business results</p></li><li><p>Strong experience with experimentation and analytics <span style="color:#5a5f72">to make product decisions, including defining hypotheses, KPIs, and success criteria</span></p></li><li><p>Excellent product judgment and analytical thinking</p></li><li><p>Ability to thrive in ambiguity and turn ideas into action</p></li><li><p>Strong stakeholder management and communication skills in English</p