chland","created_at":1792669906},{"slug":"head-senior-director-of-sales-central-europe-wetzlar-123895","company_name":"Cyclomedia Technology","title":"Head / Senior Director of Sales – Central Europe","description":"<p><strong>About Cyclomedia</strong></p><p><br>At Cyclomedia, our mission is to digitise the outside world with precision. Our geospatial technology turns street-level and aerial imagery into data and insights that cities, municipalities, utilities, telecom operators and infrastructure owners use to plan and run their operations more safely, efficiently and sustainably.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Backed by private equity investor Volpi Capital, we operate across the Netherlands, Germany, Belgium, Poland and the United States. Our customers range from Kommunen, Länder and federal authorities to Stadtwerke, utilities and telecom infrastructure companies.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Our culture is driven by curiosity and innovation, guided by impact and purpose, and built on collaboration, trust, transparency and accountability. We believe diverse perspectives drive innovation, and we are committed to building a team that reflects different backgrounds, identities and experiences. We welcome applications from everyone.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong>Job Summary</strong></p><p><br>Germany is one of Cyclomedia's most important markets and a key pillar of our growth strategy. As Head / Senior Director of Sales, Central Europe, you will lead the next phase of our growth across DACH and Poland as a hands-on sales leader who owns the pipeline, the team and the plan.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>You will build on a strong foundation: an established sales team and a base of strong reference customers. Your mandate is to take this to the next level by building a predictable, scalable sales engine with full visibility across pipeline, accounts and forecast.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Around 75% of your