the growth plan for Germany, DACH and Poland: where the next 12–24 months of revenue will come from, by vertical, segment and channel.</p></li><li><p>Translate the plan into quarterly targets, headcount needs and channel priorities, and keep it current as a live commitment.</p></li><li><p>Align public-sector buying cycles with the company's annual planning cadence.</p></li><li><p>Identify white space in the existing customer base and the wider market.</p></li><li><p>Bring structured market intelligence to the commercial leadership team, always with a recommendation.</p></li><li><p>Orchestrate pre-sales, marketing and product through influence and collaboration.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p> <br> <p><strong>Job Requirements:</strong></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><ul><li><p>10+ years in B2B sales, including 4+ years leading sales teams against revenue targets; around 15 years of overall experience is a useful guide.</p></li></ul><ul><li><p>A hands-on operating style: you personally run the forecast, the weekly cadence, the pipeline and key accounts.</p></li><li><p>Public-sector exposure: familiarity with tender mechanics, procurement rules and public-sector buying timelines.</p></li><li><p>Experience in data or technology solution sales, ideally geospatial or adjacent technology, or data-driven solutions with a long, considered buying cycle.</p></li><li><p>Experience in a larger, structured corporate environment, combined with the motivation to apply that discipline in a company where your impact is direct and visible.</p></li><li><p>Leadership people follow: you set high standards, coach people to meet them and make sound people decisions.</p></li><li><p>Fluent German and fluent English.<br></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p></li></ul><p><em>Nice to have</em></p><ul><li><p>Experience selling across several verticals such as government, utilities / Stadtwerke, telecom and infrastructure.</p></li><li><p>Familiarity with Vermessung / Kataster and municipal planning buyers.</p></li><li><p>A regional growth plan you built and executed with measurable accountability.</p></li><li><p>Experience running several sales motions at once: direct enterprise, public sector, channel / partner and inbound.</p></li><li><p>Hands-on knowledge of public procurement, including RFPs, tenders and multi-year framework agreements.</p></li><li><p>Experience aligning public-sector sales cycles with the planning cadence of an investor-backed growth business.</p></li><li><p>Polish language skills.</p></li><li><p>Based in the Wetzlar / Frankfurt region<br></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p></li></ul><p><strong>Benefits<br></strong></p><ul><li><p>Real ownership: a clear growth mandate, genuine freedom to shape the plan, and a seat on the commercial leadership team.</p></li><li><p>A strong starting point: an experienced team and solid reference customers.</p></li><li><p>Competitive package: attractive base salary plus performance-related variable pay.</p></li><li><p>Company car.</p></li><li><p>28 days of annual leave, plus public holidays.</p></li><li><p>Supplementary health insurance: treatment by senior physicians and a private room, fully paid by Cyclomedia.</p></li><li><p>Company pension (Direktversicherung) with an employer contribution.</p></li><li><p>Learning and development: team coaching, online courses and individual training.</p></li><li><p>Team events: hiking, karaoke, treasure hunts and wine tastings are all part of how we get together.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p></li></ul><p>Ready to lead the growth of one of our most important markets? Apply now and help us bring Cyclomedia's geospatial insights to the organisations shaping Central Europe.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/cyclomedia-technology/head-senior-director-of-sales-central-europe-wetzlar-123895","tags":["Sales EU"],"job_types":["Executive","fulltime permanent"],"location":"Wetzlar, Hessen, Germany","created_at":1792669906},{"slug":"remote-senior-sap-is-u-sap-s-4hana-marktkommunikation-consultant-berlin-6623","company_name":"Natuvion GmbH","title":"(Senior) SAP IS-U / SAP S/4HANA Marktkommunikation Consultant (m/w/d)","description":"<p>Du fühlst dich in der Energiebranche zu Hause und willst weiter an ihrer Digitalisierung mitarbeiten? Du hast in den letzten Jahren bereits viel Erfahrung als Berater gesammelt, hast aber jetzt <strong>Lust auf neue Projekte und Kunden</strong>? Dann passt du perfekt in unser Team!&nbsp;💚</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Die Umsetzung verschiedenster Themen in der Energiewirtschaft gehört seit der Gründung von Natuvion zu unseren <strong>wesentlichen Kernkompetenzen</strong>. Unser Team verfügt über jahrelange Erfahrung in den Kernprozessen der Energiewirtschaft und kombiniert komplexes Prozesswissen mit tiefgreifendem technologischem Verständnis. Als <strong>Special Expertise Partner von SAP</strong> kennen wir uns bestens mit der neuesten Softwaregeneration SAP S/4HANA Utilities aus. Und bei zahlreichen Energieversorgern gehören<strong> Natuvion Add-ons</strong> zum bewährten Standard der SAP for Utilities Lösung (IS-U), die die Flexibilität und Leistungsfähigkeit in vielen Bereichen erhöhen - von&nbsp;Lastgangverwaltung bis zur Abrechnung des Messstellenbetriebs.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Als <strong>(Senior) Consultant SAP IS-U (m/w/d) Marktkommunikation</strong> bist du für unsere Kunden ein zuverlässiger Berater in allen Fragen rund um die&nbsp;<strong>Marktkommunikation im SAP Utilities-Umfeld&nbsp;</strong>und&nbsp;arbeitest mit uns an verschiedenen spannenden Projekten - viele davon mit großen und&nbsp;berühmten Energieversorgern, die vielleicht auch dein Zuhause und dein<strong> Homeoffice</strong>&nbsp;warm halten.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h4>Deine Aufgaben:</h4><ul><li><p>Du bist Anspre