s at the right place and at the right time. Measurement is key, because it allows us to reach our clients' business data.</p><p>In Advertising, we are not about words, we are about results. Since we are a large team, we always work to promote teamwork and learning from each other. We welcome challenges with a smile on our faces, and we believe that our positive energy promotes good results for our clients.We are a winning team, and we have a great time working as a team. We always challenge ourselves, to foster professional and personal growth.</p><h3>What we’d like you to do</h3><ul><li><p>Act as a strategic consultant to different national and international large accounts for all their SEM Strategies.</p></li><li><p>Create strategies on the main searchers. Create, manage and track search Ads campaigns on Google Ads, Search Ads 360 and Bing Ads.</p></li><li><p>Design AI testing roadmaps and implement custom automation scripts.</p></li><li><p>Manage Business Manager and other platforms in depth.</p></li><li><p>Work closely with the clients to define objectives and follow-up on agreed roadmaps.</p></li><li><p>Maintain daily communication with the clients to review campaigns, results, and propose innovative strategies. Participate actively in meeting with clients.</p></li><li><p>Responsible for seeking efficiency and resolving it through process improvement and implementation of new technologies or improvement in their use</p></li></ul><h3>What we’d like you to bring</h3><ul><li><p>We are looking for someone who is proactive and eager to learn, with the ability to adapt to new challenges with a positive attitude.</p></li><li><p>At least 4 years of experience performing similar tasks in other marketing agencies or clients, focused on the execution and management of Paid Search campaigns, leveraging Generative AI (Gemini, ChatGPT, Claude) to optimize ad copy and strategy.</p></li><li><p>Strong proficiency in visual Generative AI tools (Midjourney, Nano Banana) to concep