&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;UK-based | Edinburgh or London | Approximately 1 day per week&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build the future, in the real world.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Principal Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to join us in a Forward Deployed role — working directly with teams to turn emerging technology and platform capabilities into real, production-ready outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This isn’t a role where you sit on the sidelines writing recommendations. You’ll get close to the problem, work alongside the people experiencing it, build the solution, and help them become self-sufficient.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll combine deep engineering expertise with strong consulting skills, curiosity and a practical bias towards delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work directly with teams to understand the outcomes they need to achieve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify where technology can create the most leverage and turn ideas into working solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and demonstrate capabilities, often ahead of wider adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work alongside technical teams, transferring knowledge so they can continue independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Feed reusable patterns, lessons and platform improvements back into the wider engineering team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a trusted technical partner, challenging assumptions and making pragmatic decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help teams make effective use of AI and emerging technology without compromising engineering quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;T-shaped Principal Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;: broad engineering capability across the full stack, with deep expertise in at least one relevant area.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll bring:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong engineering fundamentals and architectural judgement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building production systems across areas such as backend, cloud, data, web or AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong awareness of modern AI capabilities and the ability to turn them into practical outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A hands-on approach — you still want to build, review and get into the detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and consulting skills, with the ability to work with both engineers and senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A pragmatic, outcome-focused mindset. You care more about solving the right problem than building the cleverest solution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to operate comfortably in ambiguity, learn quickly and build trust with unfamiliar teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A genuine interest in transferring knowledge and raising the capability of those around you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in regulated environments would be valuable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI is part of the job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AI isn&#39;t a side skill here. We expect our Principal Engineers to be fluent in using AI to accelerate engineering while understanding where it can fail.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;That means knowing how to give AI the right context, choosing the right tools, reviewing AI-generated work critically, and building the guardrails, evaluations and quality controls needed for production systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll also help the teams you work with become more capable and confident in using AI themselves.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’re probably not the person who wants to introduce seven new technologies just because they&#39;re interesting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’re the person who walks into a complex environment, works out what actually matters, removes unnecessary complexity and builds something that makes a measurable difference.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’re comfortable saying &lt;em&gt;“this isn&#39;t really a technical problem”&lt;/em&gt; when it isn&#39;t. You can challenge senior stakeholders without ego, change your mind when the evidence changes, and make decisions without needing everything perfectly defined.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Most importantly, you enjoy working with people. You build trust quickly, get close to the problem and leave teams stronger than you found them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The practical bits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
