&lt;p&gt;We look forward to your application!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/jobs/companies/xdesign/lead-cloud-engineer-497128","tags":["Cloud"],"job_types":[],"location":"","created_at":1792680929},{"slug":"consulting-director-cloud-data-ai-aws-259452","company_name":"Xdesign","title":"Consulting Director – Cloud, Data & AI (AWS)","description":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working at CreateFuture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://createfuture.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;CreateFuture&lt;/a&gt; is a Version 1 company and an &lt;strong&gt;AI-native consulting partner&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;where people do work that matters and are supported to do it well. We work alongside organisations such as PayPal, adidas, NatWest, FanDuel and Money Saving Expert, building digital products and services that make a difference&amp;nbsp; while always putting people first.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a team of creators. We write code, shape delivery, build go-to-market strategies, develop AI solutions and create the practices that support our people. We work side by side with our clients, challenging what’s not working and helping them to build the future. Our commitment to craft, quality, and culture has helped us scale to over 600 people in just a few years.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our UK Benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;35 days leave (including bank holidays).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private medical insurance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced parental and adoption leave.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Financial coaching + 5% pension match.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;40 hours of paid learning and development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://2429507.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/2429507/CreateFuture%20Benefits%20(2026)%20(1).pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;View our full list of UK benefits.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;CreateFuture is a &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.greatplacetowork.co.uk/certified-company/1572759&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Great Place to Work-Certified™ company &lt;/a&gt;and has won Best Workplaces UK multiple years in a row.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us on our journey. Let’s create tomorrow, together, today.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2571&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;About the role and team:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At CreateFuture, we help ambitious organisations solve complex business problems through technology.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for an experienced AWS consulting leader who has spent their career advising enterprise customers—not simply designing cloud infrastructure, but helping organisations transform how they build products, use data and adopt AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is ideal for someone who has worked within AWS as a Senior or Principal Solutions Architect (or within an equivalent consulting organisation) and enjoys working directly with customers to shape strategy, influence executive stakeholders and turn technology into measurable business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll join as one of our most senior technical leaders, partnering with clients from early strategy through to delivery while helping shape some of the UK&#39;s most exciting Cloud, Data and AI transformation programmes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It&#39;s an exciting time to join us. As part of Version 1, we&#39;re investing heavily in our Cloud and AI capability and are proud to be both an &lt;strong&gt;Anthropic Preferred Services Partner&lt;/strong&gt; and an &lt;strong&gt;OpenAI Services Partner&lt;/strong&gt;. This gives our teams the opportunity to work at the forefront of enterprise AI adoption, helping customers move beyond experimentation into meaningful business transformation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;What you’ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a trusted advisor to CIOs, CTOs, CDOs and senior technology leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead executive discovery workshops, strategy engagements and technology roadmapping.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape large-scale Cloud, Data and AI transformation programmes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help customers modernise legacy platforms using modern cloud-native architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design pragmatic technology roadmaps focused on business outcomes, not just technology choices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with engineering and delivery teams to ensure strategic intent becomes successful execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support strategic opportunities, bids and executive presentations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor senior consultants and architects across the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent CreateFuture externally through customer events, industry forums and thought leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence the evolution of our Cloud, Data and AI consulting propositions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;We’d-love-to-talk-to-you-if-you:&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6821&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;We’d love to talk to you if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1t6l1qd&quot; data-start=&quot;43&quot; data-end=&quot;140&quot;&gt;Experience in enterprise consulting, gained within AWS or a leading technology consultancy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;jis33a&quot; data-start=&quot;141&quot; data-end=&quot;198&quot;&gt;Principal or Senior Solutions Architect experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;sp5vsr&quot; data-start=&quot;199&quot; data-end=&quot;285&quot;&gt;Have customer-facing consulting experience, rather than purely internal architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;e4nzqj&quot; data-start=&quot;286&quot; data-end=&quot;367&quot;&gt;Experience leading enterprise cloud, data, or AI transformation programmes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;71ubkg&quot; data-start=&quot;368&quot; data-end=&quot;470&quot;&gt;Experience working with clients across Financial Services, Retail, Gaming, or the Public Sector.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1cqxroe&quot; data-start=&quot;471&quot; data-end=&quot;530&quot;&gt;Commercial solution shaping and pre-sales experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1dh2ymk&quot; data-start=&quot;531&quot; data-end=&quot;610&quot;&gt;Experience delivering executive presentations and facilitating workshops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;6y2w3t&quot; data-start=&quot;611&quot; data-end=&quot;690&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Experience speaking at conferences, customer events, or community forums.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;_1bsb1osq _18s8y1gf _p12fukw8&quot; data-testid=&quot;view-page-labels-container&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;What-we’ll-offer-you:&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;8044&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What we’ll offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We trust people to do their best work. That means flexibility over rigid rules, impact over activity, and real investment in your growth both professionally and personally. You’ll be part of a supportive, and friendly culture, surrounded by smart, curious people who care deeply about what they do.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We offer flexible working, including hybrid and remote options. Our office hubs are located in Edinburgh, Leeds, Manchester, London and Bulgaria, with occasional travel to client sites or CreateFuture offices when needed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We trust you to manage your time balancing collaboration with client time and focused work. What matters is the impact you have, not how busy you look.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our hiring process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We try to keep our hiring process clear, fair and respectful of your time. We aim to get back to everyone who applies and we will be upfront about where you are in the process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It usually looks like this:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Call with our Talent Acquisition Team&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Role specific capability interview&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Depending on the role, we might also ask you to do a short presentation, a practical or technical task or have a values focused conversation. We will explain what is involved before anything happens.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusion at CreateFuture&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe diverse teams build better workplaces and better products. We want CreateFuture to be a place where people feel able to be themselves and do their best work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need any adjustments or support during the application process, just. We will do what we can to help.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We look forward to your application!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/jobs/companies/xdesign/consulting-director-cloud-data-ai-aws-259452","tags":["Engineering"],"job_types":[],"location":"","created_at":1792680929},{"slug":"principal-engineer-london-40114","company_name":"Langanengineeringandenvironmentalservicesllc","title":"Principal Engineer","description":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Langan provides expert Civil, Geotechnical, Traffic and Geo-Environmental engineering consulting services for major developers, renewable energy producers, energy companies, corporations, healthcare systems, colleges/universities, and large infrastructure programs around the world. Our employees collaborate seamlessly and gain valuable hands-on experience that fosters career growth. Langan culture is entrepreneurial from advancing innovative technical solutions, to participating in robust training and knowledge sharing, to making progressive change within the communities we live and work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Consistently ranked among the top ten “Best Firms to Work For” and Engineering News-Record’s top 50 firms worldwide, Langan attracts and retains the best talent in the industry. Employees thrive at Langan, a firm that fosters an inclusive and supportive work environment for all; prioritizes wellbeing, health, and safety; encourages volunteerism and philanthropy; offers workplace flexibility, along with carbon-neutral office spaces; and empowers individuals to contribute their skills and knowledge to make impactful contributions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Job Summary&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Langan is seeking a &lt;strong&gt;Principal Civil Engineer &lt;/strong&gt;to join its collaborative team in &lt;strong&gt;London, UK&lt;/strong&gt;. This individual will serve a key function in the planning, design, and permitting of civil engineering, land development, and infrastructure projects. In this role, you will have the opportunity to gain experience in site/civil engineering design for mixed-use developments, shopping centers, residential, higher education, federal, and other exciting land development projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Job Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Lead planning, design, and permitting for civil/site and infrastructure projects using engineering software (AutoCAD, Civil 3D) in collaboration with Project Engineers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Effectively uses software, reports, maps, drawings, engineering plans, tests, aerial photographs, and guidelines and manuals to assess soil composition, terrain, hydraulic and hydrological characteristics, and topographical and geologic data to plan and design projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Leads tasks associated with the preparation and modification of various engineering documents including reports, specifications, plans, cost estimates and designs for projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Perform feasibility analyses, cost calculations, and sustainability assessments for development projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Manage project tasks within established budgets and schedules.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Coordinate and perform field inspections, as required.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Prepare, review, and finalize technical reports (e.g., stormwater, utilities, feasibility studies).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Collaborate with Technical Directors on proposals, budgets, and invoice reviews.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Communicate and interface effectively with clients, subcontractors, and project stakeholders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Apply engineering principles, advanced mathematics, and sustainability/resiliency best practices to project work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Review and ensure quality of work produced by staff.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Supervise, coordinate, and mentor staff, including engineers and interns; support training and professional development.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Collaborate across offices and disciplines, supporting cross-functional project needs and training initiatives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Identify and recommend process improvements to enhance efficiency and service delivery.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Maintain current knowledge of engineering practices, regulations, and safety standards; actively participate in professional organizations and training.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Performs other duties as requested.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;8+ years’ experience in site/civil design, including site planning, grading, stormwater; management, drainage, and soil erosion is desired;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Civil Engineering;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Proven track record of delivering Data Centers for Hyperscale Clients preferred;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Knowledge of sustainability and resiliency best practices;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strong attention to detail;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Ability to multi-task effectively;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Excellent analytical and judgment capabilities;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Ability to work well individually and within groups;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strong AutoCAD and Civil 3D design skills;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Ability to oversee, coach and train staff;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Ability to occasionally participate in site visits and work during evenings and/or weekends, as needed by project schedule;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Occasional travel to project sites and/or client locations, as required;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Must have a valid driver’s license;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Langan provides a rich array of programs and benefits to help its employees advance their careers and enhance the quality of their lives. Our comprehensive compensation package includes: full-time employment company paid private medical insurance; group income protection; group life insurance; paid time off including maternity and parental leave; UK Workplace pension with company contribution; employee referral and professional license bonuses; and educational reimbursement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Langan offers employee resource groups; flexible work schedules; extensive training; wellness programs; buddy and mentoring programs; and much more!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Langan is committed to providing equal employment opportunities to all qualified applicants and employees. We believe that an inclusive workplace is essential for the well-being and success of our employees.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
