n of data at rest and in transit.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Make and record architecture decisions for the platform, and keep them visible to the wider team.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Work with the software engineering team to ensure we’re delivering the right infrastructure at the right time.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Work with our data engineers on the infrastructure behind BigQuery and our data pipelines.</p></li></ul><h3><strong>Delivery and developer experience</strong></h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own our CI/CD pipelines in GitHub Actions and make deployments quick and repeatable.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build self-service tooling so product engineers can ship and run their own services with confidence.</p></li></ul><h3><strong>Reliability and security</strong></h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Set up monitoring, logging and alerting using Cloud Monitoring, Cloud Logging, Prometheus and Grafana.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Lead root cause analysis after incidents and see the fixes through.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build security into the delivery process early, and track and address vulnerabilities across the estate.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Keep the platform in line with our regulatory obligations and internal policies.</p></li></ul><h3><strong>Leadership</strong></h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Line manage and develop our infrastructure engineer, with regular one-to-ones and a clear growth plan.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Set platform standards and help the iGaming and Rewards tech leads adopt them.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Shape the platform roadmap with the Director of Engineering and plan how the team grows.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Hire into the platform team as it expands.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><