//kraken.tech/"><u>Kraken</u></a> powers some of the most innovative global developments in energy.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We create the technology that redefines utilities and unlocks a new energy system of the future. By optimising renewable generation, building a more intelligent grid, and empowering utilities to deliver an exceptional customer experience, our operating system is transforming the industry worldwide.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">It’s an incredibly exciting time to work in energy. Join us on our mission to improve the lives of ONE BILLION humans within the decade and shape a cleaner, better future for everyone.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">🏡 <strong>Where you'll fit in:</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Kraken is growing rapidly across markets, products and geographies. We've already completed five acquisitions, and we're looking for more.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We're seeking an exceptional <strong>Head of Corporate Development</strong> to identify and execute opportunities that materially accelerate our growth and strategy.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>This is not simply an M&amp;A role.</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We want someone constantly asking: <strong>What could Kraken buy, invest in, partner with or build that would make us stronger, faster or more valuable to our clients?</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You'll own our corporate development pipeline, originate opportunities and lead transactions from initial thesis through to execution.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">That could mean an acquisition, strategic investment, joint venture, partnership or an entirely different commercial structure.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>We care about the strategic outcome, not the transaction structure.</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You'll work directly with Kraken's senior leadership and across Product, Engineering, Commercial, Finance and Legal.</p