 role.You're intellectually curious but practical. You like complexity but don't create it.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You have strong opinions, loosely held. You're comfortable challenging senior leaders and being challenged yourself.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You don't need a large team or elaborate process to get things done.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You can move from analysing a market to calling a founder, building a valuation and negotiating a deal.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">What matters is that you bring:</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Exceptional commercial judgement</strong> and strategic thinking.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong product and technology understanding.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Outstanding financial, analytical and valuation skills.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience originating, negotiating and executing complex transactions.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Confidence engaging directly with founders, CEOs, investors and Boards.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Intellectual curiosity and the ability to understand unfamiliar businesses quickly.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Comfort with ambiguity, speed and personal accountability.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Clear communication and the confidence to challenge conventional thinking.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience in technology, software, energy or utilities — particularly internationally — would be valuable.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Ultimately, we don't measure success by the number of deals completed. We measure it by whether those deals materially change Kraken's trajectory.</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">That's what we're looking for.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>Are you ready for a career with us? We want to ensure you have the right tools and environment to u