ver letter needed, we’ll ask a few questions and get back to you quickly.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><em><span style="color:#121317">Note: Contact by job agencies and recruiters will not be appreciated.</span></em></p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/dyflexis/senior-backend-engineer-php-the-hague-379414","tags":["Development"],"job_types":["Experienced","fulltime permanent"],"location":"The Hague, Zuid-Holland, Netherlands","created_at":1792669911},{"slug":"senior-full-stack-developer-php-vuejs-the-hague-323868","company_name":"Dyflexis","title":"Senior Full Stack Developer (PHP & Vue.js)","description":"<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#121317">At Dyflexis, we help millions of employees worldwide with our workforce management software. From the bakery around the corner to international hotel and retail chains. The software is powerful, customer questions are diverse, and no two days are the same. You'll get to know the product inside out and contribute to something that's growing rapidly in more than 20 other countries.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#121317">How do we do it? We work in a fast-paced environment with short communication lines. There are no unnecessary meetings and no politics. Our Focus? Ownership, clear communication, and getting things done together. We move quickly, learn by doing, and continuously improve how we support our customers. &nbsp;We're expanding the engineering team, and we need a Senior Full Stack developer who moves across the stack and unblocks whatever's stuck, frontend or backend.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p> <br> <p class="MsoNormal"><strong><span style="color:#121317">This is what you'll do</span></strong><span style="color:#121317"><br>You'll join a project squad, consisting out of a Product Owner, UX designer, and fellow engineers, and move across the stack as the work demands it. One day you're deep in a Vue.js3 component, the next you're in PHP8 and MySQL sorting out the backend logic that's blocking the Frontend team. Your job isn't to pick a lane; it's to keep features moving from idea to release for over a million users.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#121317">You'll start on tickets, get to know the codebase and how we work, then move onto full projects. We build in six-week cycles, followed by two weeks to reflect and reset. Join early, question assumptions, stay close to the team throughout.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><ul><li><p class="MsoListParagraph"><span style="color:#121317">Build features end-to-end across Vue.js3 and PHP8/ Symfony depending on what's blocking the squad</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraph"><span style="color:#121317">Design technical solutions with your fellow engineers, product owner, designer, and UX colleagues</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraph"><span style="color:#121317">Review merge requests. Give direct feedback. Take it well too. Keep performance and security front of mind: measure it, flag issues, and propose alternatives when something's off</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraph"><span style="color:#121317">Keep sight of the bigger picture: understand what you're building and why, so your work never drifts from where the product is headed</span></p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal"><strong><span style="color:#121317"><br>This is what you'll need</span></strong></p><ul><li><p class="MsoListParagraph"><span style="color:#121317">5+ years of experience as a senior Full Stack Developer, equally comfortable working across frontend and backend code. &nbsp;Bonus: B2B, SaaS, or HR-tech background.</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraph"><span style="color:#121317">Strong hands-on experience with Vue.js3, PHP 8 (Symfony), and MySQL</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraph"><span style="color:#121317">Comfortable with Git (GitLab or GitHub), Docker, and automated testing</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraph"><span style="color:#121317">A solid grip on security best practices, and the ability to measure and optimise performance</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraph"><span style="color:#121317">A problem-solving mindset, active listening, and the adaptability to switch between frontend and backend as a project need</span></p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal"><strong><span style="color:#121317"><br>What you'll get</span></strong></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#121317">At Dyflexis, you'll be part of an ambitious, energetic, and customer-focused team. We offer:</span></p><ul><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst"><span style="color:#121317">Fixed salary up to 6.500€ gross per month based on a 40-hour week (skill based)</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle"><span style="color:#121317">Personal development budget to level up your skills</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle"><span style="color:#121317">25 vacation days + your birthday off in exchange for cake</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle"><span style="color:#121317">An in-house chef surprising you daily with fresh lunch</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle"><span style="color:#121317">The best parties, drinks &amp; trips (Winter sports, Ibiza &amp; more)</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle"><span style="color:#121317">Membership at ARJ Training boxing gym (home of champion Tarik &amp; Levi Rigters)</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle"><span style="color:#121317">Solid pension plan &amp; 8% holiday allowance</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle"><span style="color:#121317">Buy or sell vacation days, you decide</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle"><span style="color:#121317">Travel allowance and WFH compensation</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast"><span style="color:#121317">Friday chair massages to kick off your weekend</span></p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong><span style="color:#121317">Apply now</span></strong><span style="color:#121317"><br>Ready to unblock a growing team and ship features a million people use?<br>Hit apply. No cover letter needed, we'll ask a few questions and get back to you quickly.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNormal"><em><span style="color:#121317">Note: Contact by job agencies and recruiters will not be appreciated.</span></em></p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/dyflexis/senior-full-stack-developer-php-vuejs-the-hague-323868","tags":["Development"],"job_types":["Experienced","fulltime permanent"],"location":"The Hague, Zuid-Holland, Netherlands","created_at":1792669911},{"slug":"senior-database-administrator-the-hague-424122","company_name":"Dyflexis","title":"Senior Database Administrator","description":"<p>At Dyflexis, we help millions of employees worldwide with our workforce management software. From the bakery around the corner to international hotel and retail chains. The software is powerful, customer questions are diverse, and no two days are the same. You'll get to know the product inside out and contribute to something that's growing rapidly in more than 20 countries.<br></p><p>How do we do it? We work in a fast-paced environment with short communication lines. There are no unnecessary meetings and no politics. Our Focus? Ownership, clear communication, and getting things done together. We move quickly, learn by doing, and continuously improve. As our Senior Database Administrator, you’ll keep our complex database fast, stable, and ready to scale, while helping developers understand the impact of their queries on performance.</p> <br> <p><strong>This is what you’ll do<br></strong>You’re responsible for the performance, stability, and scalability of our database infrastructure, spread across multiple clusters. You’ll review and optimise queries, oversee migrations, and make sure our infrastructure keeps up as we grow, all while raising the bar on how we manage data internally. You’ll work closely with our Platform team, and with developers directly to make sure the database side is considered from the start.</p><ul><li><p>Own production database performance: review and optimize queries, indexing, and execution plans using MySQL.</p></li><li><p>Run migrations across our database clusters, including working with Atlas.</p></li><li><p>Improve and evolve our database infrastructure, including scaling strategies like sharding and partitioning, as we restructure how our systems are set up.</p></li><li><p>Write and maintain the standards that keep database work consistent across teams, from data modelling to how migrations get done.</p></li><li><p>Handle regular database maintenance, from monitoring and mutations to schema changes.</p></li><li><p>Review merge requests and PHP code for how they touch the database and join project kick-offs to shape the database approach early.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong>This is what you’ll need</strong></p><ul><li><p>5+ years of experience as a database administrator or database engineer, ideally across large or complex databases.</p></li><li><p>Experience in fintech, HR tech, SaaS, or ticketing and ordering platforms is a plus. A relevant certification helps too, though it’s not a requirement.</p></li><li><p>Deep expertise in MySQL, with solid experience in at least one other Database Management System. Postgres, Oracle, or MSSQL Server are all a plus.</p></li><li><p>Familiarity PHP skills, enough to read and review how developers write queries and loops.</p></li><li><p>Excellent written and spoken English. You can communicate clearly enough so that there’s no room for misinterpretation.</p></li></ul><p><strong><br>What you'll get</strong></p><p>At Dyflexis, you'll be part of an ambitious, energetic, and customer-focused team. We offer:</p><ul><li><p>Fixed salary up to €6,500 gross per month based on a 40-hour week (experience based).</p></li><li><p>Personal development budget to level up your skills.</p></li><li><p>25 vacation days plus your birthday off in exchange for cake.</p></li><li><p>An in-house chef surprising you daily with fresh lunch.</p></li><li><p>The best parties, drinks and trips (Winter sports, Ibiza and more).</p></li><li><p>Membership at ARJ Training boxing gym (home of champion Tarik and Levi Rigters).</p></li><li><p>Solid pension plan and 8% holiday allowance.</p></li><li><p>Buy or sell vacation days, you decide.</p></li><li><p>Travel allowance and WFH compensation.</p></li><li><p>Friday chair massages to kick off your weekend.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong>Apply now</strong></p><p>Ready to bring order to our databases and help our developers build things that hold up under real load? Apply now. No cover letter needed, we’ll ask a few questions and get back to you quickly.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><em>Note: Contact by job agencies and recruiters will not be appreciated.</em></p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/dyflexis/senior-database-administrator-the-hague-424122","tags":["IT"],"job_types":["Experienced","fulltime permanent"],"location":"The Hague, Zuid-Holland, Netherlands","created_at":1792669911},{"slug":"senior-account-manager-the-hague-241176","company_name":"Dyflexis","title":"Senior Account Manager","description":"<p>At Dyflexis, we help milli